  <string name="help_barcode_title">Barcode scanning</string>
  <string name="help_barcode_text">A barcode is the same on every package of a product and holds no batch data. That is why scanning fills in only the name and category, and the expiry date always comes from the package. If the product is not found, fill it in yourself: next time it will be filled in automatically.</string>
  <string name="help_dates_title">Date recognition</string>
  <string name="help_dates_text">Tap “Recognize date” and point the camera at the date on the package. If there are several dates, the later one is taken as the expiry date and the earlier one as the production date. If there is one date and it is unclear what it means, the app will ask.\n\nRecognition is only a helper and can make mistakes. Check the date before saving: you are responsible for the data.</string>

